WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.709 --> 00:00:02.002
So, tell me
what's on your mind.

00:00:03.545 --> 00:00:04.921
Well, it just hurts.

00:00:04.921 --> 00:00:05.422
You know?

00:00:05.797 --> 00:00:07.507
When you're poor, 
all you want to be

00:00:07.507 --> 00:00:09.217
is not.

00:00:11.136 --> 00:00:14.806
Poor in Louisiana
somehow feels extra poor.

00:00:15.765 --> 00:00:17.058
There's something about being poor

00:00:17.058 --> 00:00:18.309
next to a swamp that makes you go,

00:00:18.309 --> 00:00:20.437
“Oh I might not make it 
out of this s***, okay.”

00:00:22.105 --> 00:00:22.814
There's no polite way to say so.

00:00:22.814 --> 00:00:24.024
 Across from me on the sidewalk

00:00:24.024 --> 00:00:25.692
there was a crackhead that was dancing, right?

00:00:26.651 --> 00:00:28.820
But he wasn't dancing to any music,

00:00:28.820 --> 00:00:30.113
just to the 
rhythm of the crack.

00:00:32.115 --> 00:00:33.908
I got just famous 
enough that it's like

00:00:33.908 --> 00:00:35.076
I have big t****** or something.

00:00:35.076 --> 00:00:37.078
Like, I got to be very careful

00:00:37.078 --> 00:00:38.621
when I move 
through these streets.

00:00:39.789 --> 00:00:41.499
COVID killed millions of people,

00:00:41.499 --> 00:00:43.918
but somehow everyone 
that I owe money lived.

00:00:45.795 --> 00:00:47.047
Laughter is a means to process.

00:00:47.047 --> 00:00:48.757
It's a way to exhale hurt.

00:00:48.757 --> 00:00:49.966
Some people cry.

00:00:49.966 --> 00:00:50.967
Some people scream.

00:00:50.967 --> 00:00:52.010
And I...

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:53.011
laugh.

00:00:53.011 --> 00:00:55.055
Josh Johnson!

